  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8341828369b987b23afa9e1c237ab3ad95d17056f4141eef020d9c6e7028a633",
      "text": "悟空的\n热闹午觉",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4445e0421c60e7118df2e899d18fbbf940fa7724932b50fbc9e829be2dca289a",
      "text": "悟空打了个大哈欠。\n“该睡午觉啦！”\n他来到桃树下，凉快极了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29d7af09684069b33e723b5bd8fdac8b07e9e773c57968dd36729983a057bbe2",
      "text": "八戒抱来一个枕头。\n“像云朵一样软！”\n接着，他的肚子\n咕噜咕噜叫。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1912b82ad48ee724b9fb54cba4ee300316910b2dfeb8251d8458e74b1e704d35",
      "text": "“先吃点心吧。”悟空说。\n吧唧，吧唧。\n八戒的肚子安静啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fa2ed9f02d368db6438879a63cb04f757bd37661f8fbe28dbf04992c925db83d",
      "text": "沙僧拿着大叶子，\n慢慢地扇呀扇。\n叶子蹭到了悟空的鼻子。\n“啊……啊……阿嚏！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cab8bc56a37800d7fb6a8fd6707f64fd0d26c2789cefe67d7f59ca9c0067ba1f",
      "text": "一只小鸟唱起歌。\n“啾啾！啾啾！”\n悟空坐了起来。\n“小声一点，好吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "07d6a5995aea7c37b1aa472974dff049a50d8fbb533bceac553edfc431abde83",
      "text": "八戒轻轻地嚼，\n沙僧慢慢地扇，\n小鸟小声唱：“啾……啾……”\n悟空笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cbeac3a669685a1f108e794faed4afd363866f4867d0aadab34a23cf023c3073",
      "text": "悟空轻轻吹了一口气。\n一朵小云\n绕着他的脚转圈。\n“刚刚好。”他悄悄说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8cdd25e077cb6abfc97334d04c5850ff827317297696dfb02d1a86ed633d711",
      "text": "很快，朋友们也困了。\n八戒打起呼噜：“呼噜……”\n悟空忍不住又笑了一声。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e17287c9e5763ee9b38fe18558abc266765f1637bce0f4b3ccf4fc80ee5a7c9",
      "text": "桃树下，\n大家都睡着了。\n树叶沙沙轻响，\n云朵慢慢飘过。\n英雄也需要午睡呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画使用 AI 辅助创作，由作者指导和编辑。",
